\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # Tigo - Ch\'fa H\uc0\u7893  T\'f2 M\'f2 Trong Khu R\u7915 ng Xanh\
\
Trong m\uc0\u7897 t khu r\u7915 ng xanh r\u7897 ng l\u7899 n \u7903  ch\'e2u \'c1, c\'f3 m\u7897 t ch\'fa h\u7893  tr\u7867  t\'ean l\'e0 **Tigo**. Tigo r\u7845 t t\'f2 m\'f2 v\'e0 lu\'f4n th\'edch kh\'e1m ph\'e1 m\u7885 i th\u7913  xung quanh.\
\
M\uc0\u7897 t bu\u7893 i s\'e1ng, Tigo \u273 i d\u7841 o b\'ean d\'f2ng su\u7889 i m\'e1t. Khi nh\'ecn xu\u7889 ng m\u7863 t n\u432 \u7899 c, c\u7853 u b\u7895 ng th\u7855 c m\u7855 c:\
\
\'97 T\uc0\u7841 i sao tr\'ean ng\u432 \u7901 i m\'ecnh l\u7841 i c\'f3 nhi\u7873 u s\u7885 c \u273 en th\u7871  nh\u7881 ?\
\
\uc0\u272 \'fang l\'fac \u273 \'f3, ch\'fa kh\u7881  Kiki \u273 u t\u7915  c\'e0nh c\'e2y xu\u7889 ng v\'e0 n\'f3i:\
\
\'97 M\'ecnh c\uc0\u361 ng \u273 ang mu\u7889 n h\u7887 i \u273 i\u7873 u \u273 \'f3 \u273 \u7845 y!\
\
Tigo quy\uc0\u7871 t \u273 \u7883 nh \u273 i t\'ecm c\'e2u tr\u7843  l\u7901 i.\
\
\uc0\u272 \u7847 u ti\'ean, c\u7853 u \u273 i qua m\u7897 t b\'e3i c\u7887  cao. M\u7897 t \u273 i\u7873 u k\u7923  l\u7841  x\u7843 y ra: d\'f9 Tigo r\u7845 t to l\u7899 n, nh\u7919 ng ch\'fa nai \u7903  xa l\u7841 i kh\'f3 ph\'e1t hi\u7879 n ra c\u7853 u.\
\
L\'fac \uc0\u7845 y, b\'e1c c\'fa gi\'e0 th\'f4ng th\'e1i gi\u7843 i th\'edch:\
\
\'97 Nh\uc0\u7919 ng s\u7885 c \u273 en tr\'ean b\u7897  l\'f4ng m\'e0u cam gi\'fap ch\'e1u h\'f2a v\'e0o \'e1nh s\'e1ng v\'e0 b\'f3ng c\'e2y trong r\u7915 ng. \u272 \'f3 ch\'ednh l\'e0 c\'e1ch ng\u7909 y trang c\u7911 a h\u7893 .\
\
\'97 \'c0, ra l\'e0 v\uc0\u7853 y! \'97 Tigo reo l\'ean.\
\
Ti\uc0\u7871 p t\u7909 c h\'e0nh tr\'ecnh, Tigo \u273 \u7871 n m\u7897 t con s\'f4ng r\u7897 ng. Tr\u7901 i h\'f4m \u273 \'f3 kh\'e1 n\'f3ng n\'ean c\u7853 u nh\u7843 y \'f9m xu\u7889 ng n\u432 \u7899 c.\
\
Kiki ng\uc0\u7841 c nhi\'ean:\
\
\'97 C\uc0\u7853 u kh\'f4ng s\u7907  n\u432 \u7899 c sao?\
\
\'97 Kh\'f4ng h\uc0\u7873 ! \'97 Tigo c\u432 \u7901 i l\u7899 n. \'97 H\u7893  l\'e0 m\u7897 t trong s\u7889  \'edt lo\'e0i m\'e8o r\u7845 t th\'edch b\u417 i.\
\
Hai ng\uc0\u432 \u7901 i b\u7841 n vui v\u7867  b\u417 i l\u7897 i m\u7897 t l\'fac r\u7891 i l\'ean b\u7901  ngh\u7881  ng\u417 i.\
\
Khi m\uc0\u7863 t tr\u7901 i b\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u l\u7863 n, Tigo leo l\'ean m\u7897 t t\u7843 ng \u273 \'e1 cao \u273 \u7875  ng\u7855 m khu r\u7915 ng. T\u7915  \u273 \'f3, c\u7853 u c\'f3 th\u7875  nh\'ecn r\u7845 t xa v\'e0 nghe \u273 \u432 \u7907 c nhi\u7873 u \'e2m thanh d\'f9 \u7903  c\'e1ch h\'e0ng tr\u259 m m\'e9t.\
\
B\'e1c c\'fa gi\'e0 m\uc0\u7881 m c\u432 \u7901 i:\
\
\'97 Ch\'e1u c\'f3 \uc0\u273 \'f4i m\u7855 t tinh anh, \u273 \'f4i tai nh\u7841 y b\'e9n v\'e0 nh\u7919 ng s\u7885 c l\'f4ng \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t. \u272 \'f3 l\'e0 nh\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7873 u gi\'fap h\u7893  sinh t\u7891 n trong thi\'ean nhi\'ean.\
\
Tigo nh\'ecn khu r\uc0\u7915 ng xanh tr\u432 \u7899 c m\u7863 t v\'e0 c\u7843 m th\u7845 y th\u7853 t t\u7921  h\'e0o.\
\
\'97 M\uc0\u7895 i lo\'e0i \u273 \u7897 ng v\u7853 t \u273 \u7873 u c\'f3 nh\u7919 ng kh\u7843  n\u259 ng ri\'eang. V\'e0 m\'ecnh c\u361 ng c\'f3 nh\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7873 u \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t c\u7911 a ri\'eang m\'ecnh!\
\
T\uc0\u7915  h\'f4m \u273 \'f3, Tigo kh\'f4ng c\'f2n th\u7855 c m\u7855 c v\u7873  nh\u7919 ng s\u7885 c \u273 en n\u7919 a. C\u7853 u hi\u7875 u r\u7857 ng ch\'fang ch\'ednh l\'e0 m\'f3n qu\'e0 tuy\u7879 t v\u7901 i m\'e0 thi\'ean nhi\'ean \u273 \'e3 d\'e0nh cho lo\'e0i h\u7893 .
